menu "imPress Student Module Configuration"

    config IMPRESS_EMULATOR
        bool "Emulator build (QEMU boot test only; never flash to a board)"
        default n
        help
            Builds the firmware for the TrustedInstaller boot test in Espressif's
            QEMU (#154). QEMU emulates the chip, flash and timers but not the
            radio, so this build skips the ESP-NOW mesh and logs
            "EMULATOR: ... skipped", then runs everything else. A board running
            this build cannot reach any student or gateway.
endmenu
